WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.808
A prism has a uniform cross-section along its length; a rectangular prism has 6 faces

00:00:05.808 --> 00:00:08.051
and a triangular prism has 5.

00:00:08.867 --> 00:00:14.455
How many flat faces does a rectangular prism have? The answer is 6. A rectangular

00:00:14.455 --> 00:00:19.299
prism has 6 faces, 12 edges, 8 vertices and two matching end faces.

00:00:20.117 --> 00:00:24.874
A triangular prism in a display during a library project has two matching parallel

00:00:24.874 --> 00:00:29.631
ends. How many flat faces does this solid have? Pause to choose and explain.

00:00:30.450 --> 00:00:35.506
A triangular prism in a display during a library project has two matching parallel

00:00:35.506 --> 00:00:41.284
ends. How many flat faces does this solid have? The answer is 5. A triangular prism

00:00:41.284 --> 00:00:45.618
has 5 faces, 9 edges, 6 vertices and two matching end faces.
